\n\"If someone is kind then they are furry.\" (11)\n\n\"If Harry is nice and Harry is rough then Harry is red.\" (12)\n\n\"White, rough people are kind.\" (13)\n\n\"Blue, red people are white.\" (14)\n\n\"Nice people are rough.\" (15)\n\n\"If someone is kind and furry then they are rough.\" (16)\n\nGiven that Charlie is white, but no other attributes are provided, none of these rules allow us to deduce that Charlie is rough. Therefore, the answer is C) Unknown.\n<\uff5cend\u2581of\u2581thinking\uff5c>\n\nThe correct option is: C",
